  "notes": {
    "observation-compare": "Decides whether the observation of the system after a command equals the one the specification expects.",
    "observation-compare.calcs.decide": "The answer is whether the two observations are equal: whether they have the same leaves (in any order of giving; a leaf given twice counts once), where, if the command answers and the system answered nothing, the actual observation also has the leaf `\"output\"|null|null`. Nothing is forgotten until the next Begin.",
